# Evolutionary Theory under Fire.

**Authors:** Lewin, Roger

## Abstract
Summarizes events of a conference on evolutionary biology in Chicago entitled: &quot;Macroevolution.&quot; Reviews the theory of modern synthesis, a term used to explain Darwinism in terms of population biology and genetics. Issues presented at the conference are discussed in detail. (CS)

